{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mw00/project-maya/pulls/620","id":5054509299,"node_id":"PR_kwDOU-xXos8AAAABLUWw8w","html_url":"https://github.com/mw00/project-maya/pull/620","diff_url":"https://github.com/mw00/project-maya/pull/620.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/mw00/project-maya/pull/620.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mw00/project-maya/issues/620","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mw00/project-maya/pulls/620/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mw00/project-maya/pulls/620/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mw00/project-maya/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mw00/project-maya/issues/620/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mw00/project-maya/statuses/b05f8971c83619aeaba3a824c4cc91d5d926e2c2","number":620,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"ds4 GGUF: refuse at load a layer whose experts the CPU lane cannot compute (it answered zeros); abort if one gets there","user":{"login":"SeriousRising","id":69419008,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY5NDE5MDA4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/69419008?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SeriousRising","html_url":"https://github.com/SeriousRising","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SeriousRising/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SeriousRising/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SeriousRising/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SeriousRising/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SeriousRising/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SeriousRising/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SeriousRising/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SeriousRising/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SeriousRising/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Fixes #617.\n\n**What.** `src/ds4/ds4_model.cu`, one file:\n\n- `lane_fmt_ok(l, why)`: the checks `cpu_experts_iq` / `cpu_experts_both` make before computing (the low-bit role's `gg::iq_cpu_fmt`, the activation row sizes, and for a layer with one MXFP4 role `mx_act_bytes`). `expert_layout_mx` calls it for every GGUF layer that is not all-MXFP4 and fails the load: `<layer>: the CPU lane cannot compute experts of types <gate> / <down>: <reason>`.\n- The two runtime branches that answered zeros (once-per-process stderr line, `memset` 0) now print the layer and the reason and `abort()`. The load check makes them unreachable; they stay as a backstop.\n\n**Behaviour change:** a build without ggml-cpu (`-DSTRATA_NATIVE_EXPERTS=OFF`) now refuses a low-bit pack at load, also one whose experts would all fit in VRAM. `maya.py` never makes such a build (it always passes `-DSTRATA_NATIVE_EXPERTS=ON`), so installs are not affected. Why at load rather than after placement: see #617 (placement moves at run time).\n\n**Output: unchanged** for every pack that loads. 2x CMP 170HX 64 GB (sm_80, CUDA 12.8; PCIe Gen2 x16 + Gen2 x4), DeepSeek-V4.1-Flash-1017 GSQ-RCO IQ2_XXS (routed experts IQ1_M / IQ2_XXS / IQ2_XS, 2218 on the CPU lane), `--tp 1 --gpus 0,1 --dspark on --cpu-threads 14 --suffix-draft 0`:\n\n- the pack (trunk and DSpark drafter layers) loads with no refusal; 2000 fixed prompt ids + 256 greedy tokens give the same ids and DSpark counts as v1.1.35;\n- `ds4_gguf_test`: ALL OK;\n- the refusal: a build of this branch with `-DSTRATA_NATIVE_EXPERTS=OFF` on the same pack stops at load with `maya-ds4: layers.0.ffn.experts.: the CPU lane cannot compute experts of types IQ1_M / IQ1_M: this build has no ggml-cpu (STRATA_NATIVE_EXPERTS=OFF): the low-bit experts' CPU lane is not in it` (exit 1), where v1.1.35 loads and answers zeros for those experts.\n\nNo speed change (a load-time check). **Not tested:** the runtime `abort()` backstop (no path reaches it).\n\n**Checks** (as `.github/workflows/tests.yml`): `tools/check_hip_compat.py` OK; server tests 463 OK (12 skipped); installer and tools tests 584 OK (31 skipped) - the same counts as v1.1.35.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n","labels":[],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-10-28T17:05:21Z","updated_at":"2026-10-28T21:11:06Z","closed_at":"2026-10-28T21:11:06Z","merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"7c8c8cf34ba245dce157c5a0f990af94e1926546","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"SeriousRising:ds4-cpu-lane-format-refusal","ref":"ds4-cpu-lane-format-refusal","repo":{"id":1437354424,"node_id":"R_kgDOVaxJuA","name":"project-maya","full_name":"SeriousRising/project-maya","owner":{"login":"SeriousRising","id":69419008,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY5NDE5MDA4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/69419008?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SeriousRising","html_url":"https://github.com/SeriousRising","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SeriousRising/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SeriousRising/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SeriousRising/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SeriousRising/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SeriousRising/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SeriousRising/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SeriousRising/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SeriousRising/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SeriousRising/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"private":false,"fork":true,"archived":false,"disabled":false,"description":"Project Maya - run GLM-5.3-Flash (321B MoE), DeepSeek-V4.1-Flash-1017 (748B MoE) and MiniMax-M3.1-Flash (428B MoE) privately on your ow